  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "Sufmi Dasco Ahmad, currently serving as Deputy Speaker of the House of Representatives, has become the subject of increasing public discourse regarding the vice-presidency. Multiple groups, including labor organizations like the KSPSI and various regional branches of the Gerindra party, have publicly endorsed him for the role, highlighting his perceived ability to manage political stability and represent diverse interests. In response to these developments, Dasco has publicly urged all involved parties to respect the presidential prerogative in determining the selection of a vice-president. The conversation surrounding his potential candidacy has drawn attention from various political figures, including perspectives on the implications for national political stability. As the discussion continues, supporters maintain that he possesses the necessary qualities to serve as a bridge between different social and political factions within the government.",
